      "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:20:54.686Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have some confusion regarding my Mac terminal. If I switch to the bash shell in my Mac terminal, will it affect or change any of my Mac’s basic directories and files that are required for the system to run? I am worried that by running commands I might delete or damage something important. Since the course OPP (online programming practice environment) is based on Ubuntu, should I install Ubuntu separately for practice?</p>",
